[2026-03-14T21:14:02.950Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Skm5jbXNCFexF6ndRvpf7N","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→282-\n     2→283:#### Test: Pressing C opens create issue modal\n     3→284:- **Initial state**: User is authenticated and on `/my-issues`, no modal is open, focus is not in a text input\n     4→285-- **Action**: User presses the \"C\" key\n     5→286-- **Expected**: The create issue modal opens with the title field focused.\n     6→287-\n     7→288:#### Test: Pressing C does not open modal when typing in input\n     8→289-- **Initial state**: User is authenticated, focus is in a text input field (e.g., a search field or comment box)\n     9→290-- **Action**: User presses the \"C\" key\n    10→291-- **Expected**: The character \"c\" is typed into the input field. The create issue modal does NOT open.\n    11→292-\n    12→293:#### Test: G then I navigates to My Issues\n    13→294-- **Initial state**: User is authenticated and on `/inbox`, focus is not in a text input\n    14→295-- **Action**: User presses \"G\" key, then presses \"I\" key\n    15→296-- **Expected**: User is navigated to `/my-issues`.\n    16→297-\n    17→298:#### Test: G then N navigates to Inbox\n    18→299-- **Initial state**: User is authenticated and on `/my-issues`, focus is not in a text input\n    19→300-- **Action**: User presses \"G\" key, then presses \"N\" key\n    20→301-- **Expected**: User is navigated to `/inbox`.\n    21→302-\n    22→303:#### Test: G then I does not navigate when typing in input\n    23→304-- **Initial state**: User is authenticated, focus is in a text input field\n    24→305-- **Action**: User presses \"G\" key, then \"I\" key\n    25→306-- **Expected**: The characters \"gi\" are typed into the input. No navigation occurs.\n    26→307-\n    27→308:#### Test: G chord times out if second key is delayed\n    28→309-- **Initial state**: User is authenticated and on `/my-issues`, focus is not in a text input\n